---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="RetroGuy VN — Open the Portal">
  <section class="hero">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Retro-inspired handheld experiences</p>
      <h1>OPEN THE <em>PORTAL.</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">RetroGuy creates compact game hardware and original digital worlds inspired by the feeling of carrying an entire adventure in your pocket.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button" href="/digital-realm">Explore Digital Realm</a>
        <a class="button secondary" href="/news">View development</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-visual" aria-label="Digital Realm product placeholder">
      <div class="orb"></div><div class="orb"></div><div class="device-placeholder"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="band">
    <div class="stat-row">
      <div class="stat"><strong>128×160</strong><span>Pixel-first display</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><strong>ESP32-S3</strong><span>Connected handheld core</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><strong>OTA</strong><span>Planned online updates</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><strong>3V3</strong><span>Team combat foundation</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">The project</p><h2>A pocket world,<br/>built to grow.</h2></div>
      <p>Digital Realm combines virtual-pet routines, exploration, collection, mini-games and combat with a hardware experience designed around one-handed play.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid">
      <article class="card"><span class="num">01 / EXPLORE</span><h3>Living regions</h3><p>Travel between forests, lakes, frozen peaks, sacred ruins and neon cities with NPCs, shops and activities.</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="num">02 / RAISE</span><h3>Your companion</h3><p>Care, train, evolve and build a long-term relationship with the character living inside the device.</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="num">03 / CONNECT</span><h3>Battle together</h3><p>Local multiplayer is the foundation; online services, matchmaking and persistent profiles are planned next.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Development</p><h2>Designed as a platform.</h2></div>
      <p>The website V1 is intentionally lightweight. Account, device registration, OTA, cloud save and online PvP will be added as separate services without rebuilding the public site.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/features">See features</a><a class="button secondary" href="/download">Downloads</a></div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
